## Core capabilities
- **Text:** multi-turn interactions, streaming, background execution (`background=true` for long jobs).
- **Multimodal:** image + video understanding, document (PDF) processing, audio understanding.
- **Thinking:** reasoning / thinking mode, thought signatures preserved across multi-step interactions.
- **Structured output:** schema-constrained JSON.
- **Function calling:** tools + custom functions, combinable with built-in tools.
- **Long context:** 1M-token window; long decode with Gemini 4 Argon up to the full window.
- **Grounding:** Google Search (with citations), Google Maps, URL context.
- **Tools:** code execution, file search (RAG over fileSearchStores), computer use.
- **Files API:** upload / manage media files for multimodal input.
- **Token counting, context caching, Batch API, webhooks, Flex inference (cheaper, latency-tolerant), Priority inference (business-critical).**

## Agents (managed)
- Build agents that reason, write code, manage files, browse the web. Managed agents API + Antigravity agent (multi-step tasks, file ops, tool use). Custom agents, remote sandbox **environments**, server-side **credentials** (bearer / OAuth2 / env secrets), synchronous **hooks** (intercept tool calls for security / audit), Deep Research agent.

## Live API (real-time)
- Low-latency voice + video, bidirectional WebSocket or GenAI SDK. Capabilities: session management, tool use, thinking, live transcription, live translate (speech-to-speech), ephemeral tokens for client-side auth.

## Media generation
- **Images:** Nano Banana / Nano Banana Pro (generate + edit).
- **Video:** Veo 3.1 (high-fidelity, native audio), Gemini Omni Flash (fast conversational video gen/edit).
- **Music:** Lyria 3.5 + Lyria Clip; Lyria RealTime for streaming generation; prompt guide in docs.
- **Speech:** TTS with multi-speaker audio, custom voice personas (voice design), voice replication (persistent voice IDs), voice remixing.

## Agent tooling (for coding assistants)
- **Gemini Docs MCP server:** `npx add-mcp "https://gemini-api-docs-mcp.dev"` — live doc search.
- **Skills repo:** https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-skills — `gemini-api-dev`, `gemini-live-api-dev`; `npx skills add google-gemini/gemini-skills --skill gemini-api-dev`.
- **Gemini API CLI** (`gemini-api`): stateless shell client — generate media, analyze files, run background managed agents, no project dependencies. Install: `curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google-gemini/gemini-api-cli/main/scripts/install.sh | bash` (macOS/Linux). Not an interactive coding agent; it runs inside one.

